  "instruction": "Could you help me back up all the messages from my Thunderbird Inbox by exporting each email as its own .eml file and saving them into ~/emails.bak (i.e., /home/user/emails.bak)? Please use each email\u2019s subject as the filename (preserving any non\u2011English characters), and make sure the .eml files for the messages titled \u201c\u6b61\u8fce\u4f7f\u7528\u65b0\u7684 Outlook.com \u5e33\u6236\u201d and \u201cA Test E-mail\u201d are included there.",
